Revision history for Task-BeLike-GETTY

{{$NEXT}}
  - Build the list from what my distributions use, counted from their
    cpanfiles: Type::Tiny, Log::Any, YAML::PP, YAML::XS, Cpanel::JSON::XS,
    IO::Async with Future::AsyncAwait and Net::Async::HTTP, Crypt::JWT,
    Module::Runtime, Mojolicious, Catalyst::View::Xslate, DBIO, DBD::SQLite,
    Langertha, MCP, Net::Async::MCP, Kubernetes::REST, IO::K8s, Rex,
    Test::Exception and App::karr join Moo, Moose, JSON::MaybeXS, Path::Tiny,
    LWP, Plack and Catalyst. The description names the patterns behind it.
  - Drop what is no longer a pattern across my distributions: Reflex,
    DBIx::Class and its components, Yeb, Web::Simple, PocketIO, Twiggy, the
    CSS and JavaScript minifiers, Syccess, Email::Valid, Installer, the
    DarkPAN tools, App::Ack, App::CPAN::Fresh, MooX, MooX::HasEnv,
    MooseX::Getopt, String::ProgressBar, JSON, YAML, Path::Class, IO::All,
    Config::INI, Text::Markdown, URL::Encode, Test::Dirs, the DateTime
    formatters and the TLS sanity modules.
  - Require perl 5.20, the minimum most of my distributions declare.
  - Ship misc/fingerprint, which counts what my distributions use, by CPAN
    distribution, and compares it with the list.
  - Ship misc/readme, which writes the table in README.md from the list.
  - Add a README.md.
  - Ship a LICENSE file with the Perl 5 licence text and a Changes file
    that records the earlier releases.
  - Test every push on GitHub Actions; the job installs the whole list and
    so proves that every module in it still resolves on CPAN.

20150205.000  2015-02-05 04:25:20Z
  - Add Path::Tiny, JSON::MaybeXS, Yeb, Syccess, Installer, Twiggy, PocketIO
    and the CSS/JavaScript minifiers.
  - Follow the plugin bundle to its new name,
    Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::GETTY.
  - Drop Template Toolkit, FCGI, JSON::XS, Catalyst::Plugin::AutoCRUD and
    Test::LoadAllModules, and the minimum versions of most entries.

20130420.000  2013-04-20 23:23:48Z
  - Drop Template::Stash::XS, which is not a distribution of its own.

20121001.001  2012-10-01 03:35:47Z
  - Grow the list to the Catalyst, DBIx::Class, templating, validation,
    translation, testing and DarkPAN tools in daily use.

20121001.000  2012-10-01 02:14:01Z
  - First release: Moo and Moose, Reflex, DBIx::Class, Plack and Web::Simple,
    Dist::Zilla with the GETTY plugin bundle, and the CPAN tooling around it.
